WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 25=

5
01:40.860 --> 01:41.860
Why didn't you leave just now?

6
01:43.100 --> 01:44.220
If I'd left,

7
01:44.740 --> 01:47.020
you would've cursed me with your dying breath

8
01:47.700 --> 01:48.540
for being cold and heartless.

9
01:51.860 --> 01:53.500
I never expected you to stay.

10
01:55.140 --> 01:55.740
I know.

11
02:05.980 --> 02:06.860
Come on. I'll carry you.

12
02:06.940 --> 02:07.500
No need.

13
02:08.300 --> 02:09.100
It's just the two of us.

14
02:09.340 --> 02:10.620
If we head deeper into the woods

15
02:11.260 --> 02:12.260
and Qiu Shuo's men surround us,

16
02:12.820 --> 02:13.660
we'll be in even greater danger.

17
02:17.060 --> 02:17.660
You're right.

18
02:18.620 --> 02:20.140
He might make us disappear without a trace,

19
02:20.980 --> 02:22.300
then claim we fled to escape punishment

20
02:23.020 --> 02:23.660
and vanished.

21
02:29.460 --> 02:30.140
Give me the signal flare.

22
02:41.100 --> 02:41.660
Are you insane?

23
02:41.900 --> 02:42.380
Don't light it!

24
02:42.780 --> 02:44.980
I made an agreement with Lu Yan, General of the Left Jinwu Guard.

25
02:45.580 --> 02:46.660
He promised to help me defeat the traitors.

26
02:47.660 --> 02:48.420
If he's willing

27
02:48.740 --> 02:49.580
to ride to our aid tonight,

28
02:49.820 --> 02:50.740
we'll have reinforcements.

29
02:52.420 --> 02:53.180
I just hope

30
02:53.780 --> 02:55.060
he doesn't turn out like Mu Xianqing.

31
02:55.620 --> 02:56.740
But if we send up the signal,

32
02:57.180 --> 02:58.220
the Jinwu Guards won't be the only ones to see it.

33
02:58.660 --> 02:59.620
Qiu Shuo will spot it too!

34
03:00.100 --> 03:01.180
Even if we don't,

35
03:01.820 --> 03:03.060
Qiu Shuo will find us sooner or later.

36
03:03.060 --> 03:04.980
Even if Lu Yan keeps his promise,

37
03:05.580 --> 03:06.620
he's far beyond the hunting grounds,

38
03:07.100 --> 03:08.220
while Qiu Shuo is right nearby.

39
03:08.460 --> 03:10.420
If the Jinwu Guards arrive after Qiu Shuo,

40
03:10.940 --> 03:11.940
we're dead anyway.

41
03:13.220 --> 03:14.500
There's one more possibility.

42
03:15.780 --> 03:16.660
If the Jinwu Guards

43
03:17.500 --> 03:18.500
get here before Qiu Shuo,

44
03:19.100 --> 03:19.980
we'll be saved.

45
03:21.740 --> 03:23.380
How is that even possible?

46
03:24.900 --> 03:26.300
Even if the odds are slim

47
03:27.220 --> 03:28.220
and we're almost certain to die,

48
03:29.500 --> 03:30.260
so what?

49
03:31.060 --> 03:32.140
As long as there's a chance,

50
03:32.580 --> 03:33.540
we have to take it.

51
03:41.780 --> 03:42.380
All right, then.

52
03:43.300 --> 03:44.340
Tonight, I, Yang Si,

53
03:44.740 --> 03:46.100
risked my life to stand by you.

54
03:47.140 --> 03:48.460
I've already put my neck on the line.

55
03:50.740 --> 03:51.500
Might as well

56
03:52.580 --> 03:53.740
take one more gamble with you!

57
04:05.340 --> 04:06.660
So that's where they are!

58
04:07.180 --> 04:07.500
Move!

59
04:10.380 --> 04:10.820
General Lu,

60
04:11.220 --> 04:12.220
whoever sent up that signal

61
04:12.340 --> 04:13.180
should be a few miles away.

62
04:13.420 --> 04:14.060
Shall we move out?

63
04:29.820 --> 04:30.260
Mu Xun.

64
04:33.220 --> 04:34.380
Your heart is pounding.

65
04:35.780 --> 04:36.660
I can hear it.

66
04:39.660 --> 04:40.140
Really?

67
04:44.980 --> 04:45.700
Stay alert!

68
04:46.100 --> 04:47.140
You guys, go that way!

69
04:47.300 --> 04:47.740
Yes, sir!

70
04:47.940 --> 04:48.620
The rest of you, follow me!

71
04:48.900 --> 04:49.260
Yes, sir!

72
04:50.580 --> 04:50.900
Come on!

73
05:08.820 --> 05:10.020
So it ends the same way after all.

74
05:13.660 --> 05:16.220
Making an ally of someone like Mu Xianqing...

75
05:17.380 --> 05:19.540
Weren't you afraid he'd turn on you?

76
05:24.780 --> 05:25.660
I'm sorry, Yang Si.

77
05:26.860 --> 05:27.940
I'll get you killed this time.

78
05:29.900 --> 05:31.500
Better to die fighting in righteous fury

79
05:32.580 --> 05:34.140
than live in disgrace under that treacherous eunuch.

80
05:36.020 --> 05:36.460
Your Royal Highness,

81
05:37.260 --> 05:38.340
you asked me ten years ago,

82
05:39.180 --> 05:41.100
and I said I'd always stand by your side

83
05:42.060 --> 05:42.940
until my very last breath.

84
05:43.740 --> 05:44.540
That hasn't changed.

85
05:47.820 --> 05:48.740
Then let's fight them together.

86
05:52.740 --> 05:53.820
The Crown Prince, Mu Xun,

87
05:54.460 --> 05:54.980
has plotted

88
05:55.460 --> 05:56.620
to seize the throne before his time,

89
05:56.980 --> 05:58.060
murder his father, and rebel!

90
05:58.820 --> 06:00.900
Yang Si of the Court of Judicial Review is his lackey,

91
06:01.300 --> 06:02.180
guilty of high treason!

92
06:02.580 --> 06:03.540
Seize them both!

93
06:05.540 --> 06:06.620
Kill them on sight!

94
06:07.580 --> 06:08.020
Yes, sir!

95
06:33.380 --> 06:34.420
General Meng.

96
06:35.540 --> 06:36.500
I never thought

97
06:37.060 --> 06:39.340
you'd get mixed up in this mess too!

98
06:40.500 --> 06:41.180
These are your men?

99
06:42.940 --> 06:43.900
What are you doing, General Meng?

100
06:45.220 --> 06:46.380
I wonder if Your Royal Highness

101
06:47.260 --> 06:48.500
has any regrets now.

102
06:49.540 --> 06:50.740
Why bother with Mu Xianqing?

103
06:51.300 --> 06:52.340
You should've come to me!

104
06:56.980 --> 06:58.140
Yan Shang? What are you doing here?

105
06:58.820 --> 07:00.140
Quick! Get out of here!

106
07:00.620 --> 07:01.620
I'll explain everything later.

107
07:01.660 --> 07:02.300
But what about here?

108
07:03.460 --> 07:04.300
Get the Crown Prince to safety!

109
07:04.580 --> 07:05.340
I'll deal with my friends here!

110
07:05.340 --> 07:06.420
Come on! Leave it to him!

111
07:16.300 --> 07:18.100
I saw Mu Xianqing's body just now.

112
07:19.820 --> 07:20.300
Thank you.

113
07:21.020 --> 07:22.500
I killed him for Lord Yu.

114
07:23.420 --> 07:24.300
It had nothing to do with you.

115
07:25.220 --> 07:25.700
Qiu Shuo,

116
07:26.460 --> 07:27.660
I've rarely respected anyone in my life.

117
07:28.460 --> 07:29.700
You're a true hero of our time.

118
07:30.180 --> 07:31.380
Why be that eunuch's lapdog?

119
07:31.500 --> 07:32.020
Shut up!

120
07:33.180 --> 07:35.340
Lord Yu recognized my worth and gave me my chance.

121
07:36.220 --> 07:38.260
He cared for my parents in life and buried them in death.

122
07:39.180 --> 07:40.420
For ten years of fighting rebellions,

123
07:41.300 --> 07:43.460
I've risked my life fighting by his side.

124
07:45.700 --> 07:46.540
But you...

125
07:47.300 --> 07:49.460
You killed your lord in the Central Circuit and seized power!

126
07:49.860 --> 07:51.700
I am nothing like you!

127
07:52.460 --> 07:53.260
I would never

128
07:53.780 --> 07:55.380
betray my lord!

129
08:43.460 --> 08:44.700
Now Meng's getting involved too.

130
08:45.820 --> 08:47.420
He can't seriously want to be your brother-in-law, can he?

131
08:48.060 --> 08:48.660
Yang Si,

132
08:49.340 --> 08:50.180
give it a rest.

133
08:50.580 --> 08:51.340
Stop talking nonsense.

134
08:51.340 --> 08:52.540
Your Royal Highness, your wound...

135
08:55.700 --> 08:56.220
I hear something.

136
09:00.540 --> 09:01.300
Hoofbeats.

137
09:12.060 --> 09:13.380
(Lu Yan, General of the Left Jinwu Guard)

138
09:13.380 --> 09:14.860
I am Lu Yan of the Left Jinwu Guard.

139
09:15.060 --> 09:15.780
Forgive my late arrival

140
09:16.020 --> 09:17.300
to rescue you, Your Royal Highness.

141
09:20.300 --> 09:21.340
Lu Yan, hear my orders.

142
09:21.940 --> 09:22.980
Join me in a counterattack

143
09:23.580 --> 09:24.660
and kill the treacherous eunuch!

144
09:26.020 --> 09:26.340
Yes!

145
09:34.380 --> 09:35.020
What time is it?

146
09:35.780 --> 09:36.900
It's already past the hour of Chou.

147
09:38.500 --> 09:39.220
It's taken far too long.

148
09:39.780 --> 09:40.580
Qiu Shuo is in grave danger.

149
09:41.020 --> 09:41.500
Sir,

150
09:42.660 --> 09:43.740
we must act quickly.

151
09:47.100 --> 09:47.740
Send word

152
09:48.140 --> 09:48.900
to the Shence Army.

153
09:49.140 --> 09:50.220
Have them enter the hunting grounds early as reinforcements.

154
09:51.100 --> 09:51.420
Yes.

155
10:00.420 --> 10:00.860
Wenji.

156
10:02.980 --> 10:04.380
There's likely to be chaos here.

157
10:04.900 --> 10:06.100
Keep a close eye on His Majesty

158
10:06.860 --> 10:07.580
and that woman for me.

159
10:08.540 --> 10:09.500
Don't disappoint me.

160
10:11.620 --> 10:11.940
Yes.

161
10:39.260 --> 10:39.660
Yang Si,

162
10:40.180 --> 10:41.260
once we're inside, attack immediately.

163
10:41.580 --> 10:42.300
End it quickly.

164
10:43.020 --> 10:44.220
Don't give Yu Cheng'an a chance to speak,

165
10:44.380 --> 10:45.300
or he'll pull the same trick again.

166
10:45.580 --> 10:45.980
Understood!

167
10:49.620 --> 10:49.940
Don't be afraid.

168
10:52.300 --> 10:52.780
Wenji,

169
10:54.420 --> 10:55.540
why did Lord Yu have me captured?

170
10:57.180 --> 10:58.420
Why is His Majesty here?

171
11:02.220 --> 11:03.260
Am I going to die?

172
11:03.500 --> 11:04.220
Don't ask any questions.

173
11:13.860 --> 11:14.220
Chunhua!

174
11:15.300 --> 11:15.700
Chunhua!

175
11:27.300 --> 11:28.300
(Huai)

176
11:33.460 --> 11:33.940
Yu Cheng'an

177
11:34.580 --> 11:35.460
has seized control of the government

178
11:35.700 --> 11:36.460
and committed countless abuses!

179
11:37.180 --> 11:38.620
Now he even dares to frame the Crown Prince!

180
11:38.900 --> 11:39.660
His crimes are unforgivable!

181
11:40.540 --> 11:42.060
Lu Yan of the Left Jinwu Guard, hear my orders!

182
11:43.380 --> 11:44.580
Storm the temporary imperial palace with me

183
11:45.340 --> 11:46.140
and wipe out the traitor!

184
11:47.940 --> 11:49.100
How dare you, Lu Yan.

185
11:49.660 --> 11:50.900
You dare storm here?

186
11:51.140 --> 11:52.900
Are you conspiring with the Crown Prince

187
11:53.340 --> 11:54.300
to commit treason?

188
11:54.700 --> 11:55.460
Treason?

189
11:57.740 --> 11:59.020
General Lu, don't waste your breath on him.

190
11:59.820 --> 12:01.620
His Majesty is resting inside.

191
12:02.060 --> 12:02.980
General Lu,

192
12:03.420 --> 12:04.300
what do you intend to do?

193
12:04.860 --> 12:05.420
What?

194
12:07.300 --> 12:09.140
Isn't His Majesty at Taiji Palace?

195
12:11.380 --> 12:12.740
Where His Majesty is,

196
12:13.180 --> 12:13.940
surely the Crown Prince

197
12:14.660 --> 12:15.860
knows perfectly well.

198
12:17.300 --> 12:20.020
The Crown Prince and Mr. Yang both saw him earlier.

199
12:20.420 --> 12:20.940
His Majesty

200
12:21.580 --> 12:22.940
is right here.

201
12:23.540 --> 12:25.500
Yet you dare lead troops inside

202
12:25.500 --> 12:26.780
and plot against the Emperor!

203
12:27.260 --> 12:28.820
Aren't you afraid your entire clan will be executed?

204
12:34.820 --> 12:35.340
Your Royal Highness,

205
12:35.900 --> 12:36.940
is that true?

206
13:04.300 --> 13:04.780
Wenji.

207
13:05.340 --> 13:05.820
Wenji.

208
13:06.140 --> 13:06.620
Chunhua.

209
13:08.020 --> 13:08.500
I'm right here.

210
13:09.940 --> 13:10.500
I'm here with you.

211
13:16.100 --> 13:17.220
Utter nonsense!

212
13:21.660 --> 13:23.540
Every official knows His Majesty is unwell.

213
13:24.340 --> 13:26.140
He hasn't appeared in public since the birthday banquet.

214
13:26.220 --> 13:27.700
He's been recovering at Taiji Palace.

215
13:28.380 --> 13:29.460
Even this winter hunt

216
13:29.820 --> 13:32.300
was entrusted entirely to Lord Yu by His Majesty.

217
13:32.740 --> 13:35.140
His Majesty personally granted Lord Yu use of the temporary imperial palace.

218
13:35.780 --> 13:36.540
Everyone knows that.

219
13:37.300 --> 13:38.340
The only person

220
13:38.620 --> 13:40.180
staying here is Lord Yu.

221
13:41.020 --> 13:41.940
How could His Majesty be here?

222
13:42.180 --> 13:43.380
Lord Yu is indeed here.

223
13:44.300 --> 13:45.140
But so

224
13:45.940 --> 13:46.500
is His Majesty.

225
13:49.540 --> 13:50.060
Is that so?

226
13:51.580 --> 13:53.540
But Sheng'an's over 50 li away.

227
13:54.100 --> 13:55.700
It's hardly a short walk.

228
13:56.500 --> 13:58.180
If His Majesty really traveled to the hunting grounds,

229
13:58.900 --> 13:59.660
surely someone along the way

230
14:00.420 --> 14:02.500
would've seen his imperial procession.

231
14:02.780 --> 14:04.540
His Majesty traveled with a small escort,

232
14:05.420 --> 14:06.540
disguised as a commoner.

233
14:06.980 --> 14:08.100
All the court officials are here.

234
14:08.900 --> 14:10.660
The Crown Prince and Princess are here.

235
14:11.020 --> 14:12.740
Even the military governors of two Circuits are here.

236
14:13.300 --> 14:15.220
Yet the Emperor alone came in disguise?

237
14:15.500 --> 14:16.500
General Lu,

238
14:17.220 --> 14:18.140
does that sound believable to you?

239
14:27.900 --> 14:28.580
The Crown Prince

240
14:29.060 --> 14:29.700
and Yang Si

241
14:30.580 --> 14:32.820
stormed the temporary imperial palace hours ago and threatened His Majesty,

242
14:32.820 --> 14:34.260
committing an act of high treason.

243
14:35.220 --> 14:37.020
Lord Yu ordered us to defend the Emperor with our lives.

244
14:37.180 --> 14:38.540
That's the only reason their plot failed.

245
14:39.260 --> 14:40.900
But after they escaped,

246
14:40.940 --> 14:42.820
they somehow tricked General Lu into coming here.

247
14:43.860 --> 14:45.700
What kind of position

248
14:46.140 --> 14:47.140
are they putting General Lu in?

249
14:58.260 --> 14:58.740
Your Royal Highness,

250
14:59.540 --> 15:00.140
Mr. Yang,

251
15:01.700 --> 15:02.860
you told me

252
15:02.940 --> 15:04.580
that the person you saw

253
15:04.700 --> 15:05.700
inside the temporary imperial palace wasn't His Majesty.

254
15:06.300 --> 15:07.100
Is that true?

255
15:16.780 --> 15:17.260
That's right.

256
15:18.340 --> 15:18.980
My father

257
15:19.940 --> 15:21.300
never came to the hunting grounds!

258
15:22.220 --> 15:23.820
That treacherous Yu Cheng'an had the nerve

259
15:24.180 --> 15:26.100
to plant a double in the temporary imperial palace

260
15:26.540 --> 15:27.620
and frame me for treason!

261
15:29.020 --> 15:29.540
That man

262
15:30.340 --> 15:31.620
looks and sounds

263
15:31.940 --> 15:33.020
just like my father.

264
15:34.180 --> 15:34.740
But

265
15:35.060 --> 15:36.980
as his son, I know what I saw.

266
15:37.380 --> 15:39.580
He is a double!

267
15:44.020 --> 15:44.980
Your Royal Highness,

268
15:45.540 --> 15:47.020
there can be only one ruler,

269
15:47.820 --> 15:49.580
but why are you in such a hurry to take his place?

270
15:50.220 --> 15:51.540
His Majesty has retired for the night.

271
15:52.180 --> 15:54.060
Lord Yu and I didn't wish to disturb him.

272
15:54.700 --> 15:56.060
But given the circumstances,

273
15:56.740 --> 15:58.660
we may have no choice but to request His Majesty's presence

274
15:58.980 --> 15:59.980
and let General Lu

275
16:00.460 --> 16:01.660
see for himself.

276
16:03.460 --> 16:03.900
Chunhua,

277
16:04.460 --> 16:05.140
I don't care about anyone else.

278
16:06.020 --> 16:06.820
You have to stay alive.

279
16:17.020 --> 16:17.540
Wenji!

280
16:18.180 --> 16:18.780
Wenji!

281
16:20.260 --> 16:20.740
Wenji!

282
16:28.340 --> 16:28.780
Chunhua,

283
16:30.420 --> 16:31.060
you must survive.

284
16:31.980 --> 16:32.900
Your baby must survive too.

285
17:04.260 --> 17:05.580
I am Princess Danyang!

286
17:08.820 --> 17:10.220
I have His Majesty's written decree!

287
17:34.660 --> 17:35.580
Princess Danyang,

288
17:36.340 --> 17:37.460
how can you prove

289
17:37.700 --> 17:38.780
the decree is genuine?

290
17:40.540 --> 17:41.460
I met with His Majesty

291
17:42.580 --> 17:43.500
and brought back his decree.

292
17:44.020 --> 17:45.740
Every city gate and palace gate I passed through

293
17:46.060 --> 17:46.820
has a record of my passage.

294
17:47.540 --> 17:48.340
How could it be fake?

295
17:54.060 --> 17:54.420
Your Highness,

296
17:55.140 --> 17:56.100
aren't we heading straight back to the hunting grounds?

297
17:56.460 --> 17:57.260
To my residence first!

298
18:13.340 --> 18:15.580
(By imperial command: Meng Baiyu has shown virtue and loyalty.)

299
18:15.580 --> 18:17.960
(Our eldest daughter, Princess Danyang, is gentle, virtuous, and well-mannered.)

300
18:17.960 --> 18:20.660
(I hereby decree her marriage into the Meng family. May they prosper.)

301
18:20.660 --> 18:23.240
(May they enjoy marital harmony. Let this decree be carried out.)

302
18:29.940 --> 18:31.140
General of the Left Jinwu Guard,

303
18:31.700 --> 18:32.140
Lu Yan,

304
18:32.860 --> 18:33.340
receive the imperial decree!

305
18:34.580 --> 18:34.900
At your command!

306
18:37.700 --> 18:38.700
"Since Yu became one of the Three Excellencies,

307
18:39.300 --> 18:40.140
the wilds hold starved corpses,

308
18:40.900 --> 18:41.780
our nation has suffered countless calamities,

309
18:42.260 --> 18:43.140
and countless families have wept,

310
18:43.860 --> 18:44.700
while one man alone enjoys power and glory.

311
18:45.740 --> 18:47.180
I entrusted Huai to the Yu family

312
18:47.740 --> 18:48.700
and made a terrible mistake.

313
18:49.220 --> 18:50.220
Now I must set things right.

314
18:50.660 --> 18:52.980
The Jinwu Guard shall aid the Crown Prince in slaying this traitor

315
18:53.820 --> 18:54.860
and saving our people.

316
18:55.260 --> 18:56.860
Those who charge forward shall receive a hundred strings of coins.

317
18:57.540 --> 18:58.180
Whoever takes the traitor's head

318
18:58.540 --> 18:59.620
shall be granted the title of Marquis for military merit!"

319
19:00.860 --> 19:01.780
Princess Danyang,

320
19:02.620 --> 19:03.260
forging an imperial decree

321
19:03.820 --> 19:05.100
is punishable by death.

322
19:06.900 --> 19:07.940
Those who follow her

323
19:08.980 --> 19:10.540
will have their entire clans executed!

324
19:13.580 --> 19:16.060
The Princess received this decree at Taiji Palace,

325
19:16.380 --> 19:18.420
directly from His Majesty himself.

326
19:18.900 --> 19:21.340
Even if you bring out a double

327
19:22.180 --> 19:23.300
and manage to fool everyone else,

328
19:24.220 --> 19:26.700
how could you fool the Crown Prince and Princess?

329
19:28.780 --> 19:29.700
An hour ago,

330
19:30.340 --> 19:31.660
my father was at Taiji Palace,

331
19:31.940 --> 19:33.100
giving me this decree in person.

332
19:33.620 --> 19:34.820
He's been ill for a long time.

333
19:35.100 --> 19:36.300
Even as he affixed the imperial seal,

334
19:36.660 --> 19:37.500
he was coughing and struggling to breathe.

335
19:38.460 --> 19:39.420
How could he possibly travel

336
19:39.700 --> 19:40.980
all the way to this temporary imperial palace?

337
19:43.540 --> 19:44.100
General Lu,

338
19:45.220 --> 19:46.780
the Crown Prince and Princess of Huai

339
19:47.420 --> 19:48.900
stand before you with His Majesty's decree.

340
19:49.620 --> 19:50.420
Will you believe us,

341
19:51.300 --> 19:53.180
or these traitors who have no proof at all?

342
19:59.100 --> 20:00.020
Princess Danyang,

343
20:00.420 --> 20:01.580
I'll claim the first victory!

344
20:11.060 --> 20:11.540
Catch!

345
20:22.260 --> 20:23.420
Qiu Shuo is dead.

346
20:27.020 --> 20:28.140
His Majesty's decree is before us.

347
20:28.780 --> 20:30.460
The Jinwu Guard shall obey His Majesty's commands

348
20:30.740 --> 20:31.940
and fight these treacherous rebels!

349
20:32.340 --> 20:33.140
It is our duty!

350
20:36.020 --> 20:36.540
General Lu!

351
20:36.700 --> 20:37.220
General Meng!

352
20:37.940 --> 20:39.540
We must strike against that traitor Yu immediately!

353
20:40.460 --> 20:40.940
Charge!

354
20:56.580 --> 20:57.100
Sir.

355
20:58.180 --> 20:59.260
The Shence Army hasn't arrived.

356
21:00.540 --> 21:01.740
We can't stay here any longer.

357
21:51.020 --> 21:51.380
Lord Yu.

358
21:52.260 --> 21:52.660
Lord Yu.

359
21:53.940 --> 21:54.420
Just now,

360
21:54.980 --> 21:55.940
Prince of Jin's secondary consort labored prematurely.

361
21:56.540 --> 21:57.100
and gave birth.

362
22:04.780 --> 22:06.220
This is Huai's new heir to the throne.

363
22:08.820 --> 22:09.140
Let's go.

364
22:11.340 --> 22:11.700
Godfather,

365
22:13.340 --> 22:14.220
what about that woman?

366
22:14.460 --> 22:15.100
What should we do with her?

367
22:20.940 --> 22:21.340
Lord Yu.

368
22:28.780 --> 22:29.580
A baby this young

369
22:30.340 --> 22:31.460
may not survive

370
22:31.940 --> 22:32.620
without its mother.

371
22:32.900 --> 22:33.300
Bring them both.

372
22:33.580 --> 22:33.860
Yes.

373
23:03.940 --> 23:04.380
You two,

374
23:05.460 --> 23:06.900
do you still have the daggers

375
23:07.180 --> 23:07.780
I gave you earlier?

376
23:11.060 --> 23:12.020
The man on the bed...

377
23:12.540 --> 23:13.780
I'll leave him to you.

378
23:20.140 --> 23:21.940
Didn't you hear what they said outside?

379
23:22.100 --> 23:23.580
That man is just a double,

380
23:23.660 --> 23:24.580
not the real emperor.

381
23:24.620 --> 23:25.220
What are you afraid of?

382
23:31.140 --> 23:31.900
Rest assured, Mr. Wei.

383
23:32.260 --> 23:32.700
I...

384
23:33.420 --> 23:34.420
am willing to see this through.

385
23:49.060 --> 23:49.820
You came back after all.

386
23:50.420 --> 23:51.180
If I hadn't,

387
23:51.700 --> 23:52.780
how would you have gotten out of that?

388
23:53.460 --> 23:54.700
I'm sorry about what happened earlier.

389
23:55.260 --> 23:56.900
I had to claim only a double was at the temporary imperial palace.

390
23:57.340 --> 23:59.100
It was the only way to give Huai and His Majesty a chance to survive.

391
23:59.340 --> 24:00.100
You're right.

392
24:07.820 --> 24:08.380
Father!

393
24:19.340 --> 24:19.860
Lord Yu,

394
24:20.620 --> 24:21.620
it's all taken care of.

395
24:23.140 --> 24:24.300
Wang Qing went weak at the sight of blood

396
24:24.820 --> 24:25.740
and is still lying on the floor inside.

397
24:29.860 --> 24:30.220
Lord Yu,

398
24:30.780 --> 24:31.420
I'm a skilled rider.

399
24:31.740 --> 24:32.540
I can ride with one hand.

400
24:33.060 --> 24:34.060
Please let me carry the heir.

401
24:35.540 --> 24:35.900
All right.

402
24:43.620 --> 24:44.980
The Shence Army will meet us to the east.

403
24:45.580 --> 24:46.900
Follow me. We'll join them there.

404
25:19.740 --> 25:20.140
Father!

405
25:30.620 --> 25:31.140
I'm fine.

406
25:31.140 --> 25:31.540
Father!

407
25:32.980 --> 25:33.420
Father!

408
25:34.780 --> 25:35.380
We're safe now.

409
25:36.820 --> 25:37.580
Thank goodness!

410
25:38.700 --> 25:39.300
Father.

411
25:41.820 --> 25:43.260
Yan Shang pays his respects to Your Majesty.

412
25:56.180 --> 25:56.660
Father.

413
26:40.140 --> 26:40.500
Move aside!

414
26:51.500 --> 26:52.180
How dare you!

415
26:53.820 --> 26:54.620
Guards!

416
26:54.980 --> 26:55.460
Come on!

417
26:55.780 --> 26:57.580
Someone! Get in here!

418
26:58.980 --> 27:00.620
Help!

419
28:07.260 --> 28:07.980
I'll go get her!

420
28:11.060 --> 28:11.820
Go! Sir, hurry!

421
28:15.660 --> 28:16.060
Chunhua!

422
28:22.100 --> 28:22.420
Go!

423
28:43.340 --> 28:43.780
Chunhua!

424
28:44.940 --> 28:45.340
Chunhua!

425
28:46.860 --> 28:47.140
Come on!

426
28:47.420 --> 28:47.900
Wenji...

427
28:48.740 --> 28:49.660
I can't run anymore.

428
28:50.900 --> 28:51.540
Go without me.

429
28:51.540 --> 28:51.940
No.

430
28:55.260 --> 28:55.900
Search over there!

431
28:56.340 --> 28:56.780
- Hurry! - Yes, sir!

432
28:59.380 --> 28:59.860
After them!

433
29:03.020 --> 29:03.940
Search every inch!

434
29:04.180 --> 29:04.820
Look carefully!

435
29:05.380 --> 29:06.260
- Yes, sir! - Yes, sir!

436
29:44.260 --> 29:44.660
Chunhua.

437
29:45.780 --> 29:46.220
Chunhua.

438
29:47.300 --> 29:47.740
Chunhua.

439
29:52.540 --> 29:53.060
It's all right now.

440
29:54.300 --> 29:55.180
We're safe, Chunhua.

441
29:56.580 --> 29:57.380
We're still alive.

442
29:57.700 --> 29:58.900
And so is the baby.

443
30:36.580 --> 30:36.940
Zidu!

444
30:38.900 --> 30:39.460
Zidu, hurry!

445
30:40.060 --> 30:40.380
Get on the horse!

446
30:41.660 --> 30:41.980
Quick!

447
31:07.500 --> 31:08.140
This is

448
31:08.980 --> 31:10.500
as far as I can go with you.

449
31:36.580 --> 31:37.020
Wenji.

450
31:39.700 --> 31:40.700
What do we do now?

451
31:45.340 --> 31:45.660
Wait.

452
31:47.780 --> 31:48.300
Wait for what?

453
31:48.940 --> 31:49.700
For dawn.

454
31:51.940 --> 31:52.940
Until the losers are branded traitors.

455
32:03.980 --> 32:05.140
Why is the baby so wrinkly?

456
32:05.740 --> 32:06.580
Kind of ugly, actually.

457
32:13.220 --> 32:13.500
No.

458
32:15.980 --> 32:16.540
Adorable.

459
32:21.100 --> 32:21.460
Just like you.

460
32:30.780 --> 32:31.260
Wenji,

461
32:33.460 --> 32:34.420
I can't remember

462
32:35.700 --> 32:36.980
the last time

463
32:37.860 --> 32:38.700
I felt this happy.

464
32:54.580 --> 32:55.140
Tell me,

465
32:55.860 --> 32:56.660
when morning comes,

466
32:57.340 --> 32:57.900
where should we go?

467
32:59.460 --> 32:59.900
Where?

468
33:00.780 --> 33:02.020
I'd love to go back to Lingnan.

469
33:04.180 --> 33:06.340
To that little hillside where we first met.

470
33:07.740 --> 33:08.660
Lingnan is so warm.

471
33:10.260 --> 33:10.940
And full of flowers.

472
33:12.660 --> 33:13.260
I love it there.

473
33:22.060 --> 33:22.420
All right.

474
33:24.860 --> 33:25.540
When we get there,

475
33:28.340 --> 33:29.300
I'll lead your horse for you again.

476
33:32.780 --> 33:34.540
Then let's settle down in a little village.

477
33:35.460 --> 33:36.420
Somewhere no one knows me,

478
33:37.140 --> 33:38.180
and no one knows you.

479
33:40.340 --> 33:43.780
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

480
33:44.660 --> 33:45.660
We'll find a place

481
33:46.780 --> 33:47.500
with mountains

482
33:49.140 --> 33:50.300
and streams.

483
33:50.300 --> 33:51.980
♪The moon wanes and waxes, lovers part and reunite♪

484
33:51.980 --> 33:53.020
We'll raise a few chickens and ducks.

485
33:54.540 --> 33:55.260
And out front,

486
33:56.620 --> 33:58.900
we'll plant some of your favorite flowers.

487
34:00.140 --> 34:01.100
But I don't know how to raise chickens or ducks.

488
34:01.380 --> 34:02.180
Or grow flowers.

489
34:02.180 --> 34:04.660
♪Time lies sealed beneath clouds heavy with rain♪

490
34:04.660 --> 34:04.980
That's okay.

491
34:06.020 --> 34:06.700
I'll take care of everything.

492
34:06.700 --> 34:09.380
♪As darkness engulfs the palace and wildlands sway♪

493
34:09.420 --> 34:14.060
♪What can I do, with no one to light the way?♪

494
34:15.260 --> 34:19.000
♪Ask not why spring is so hard to leave; One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

495
34:19.000 --> 34:22.820
♪Ask not why spring is so hard to leave; One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

496
34:22.900 --> 34:25.300
♪Fate falls just short of granting our plea♪

497
34:25.420 --> 34:27.700
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

498
34:27.940 --> 34:31.580
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

499
34:31.700 --> 34:35.500
♪Ask not why longing has no end; I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

500
34:35.500 --> 34:39.380
♪Ask not why longing has no end; I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

501
34:39.620 --> 34:41.780
♪May sorrow end, though sleepless we lie apart♪

502
34:41.860 --> 34:43.860
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

503
34:43.940 --> 34:48.060
♪Though close at hand, we're worlds apart♪

504
34:48.060 --> 34:48.940
Is it almost dawn?

505
34:58.780 --> 35:00.460
I wish the sun would never rise.

506
35:19.180 --> 35:19.860
Everyone, over here!

507
35:25.740 --> 35:26.420
Who are you people?

508
35:29.380 --> 35:29.740
Take them away!

509
35:30.180 --> 35:30.540
Yes, sir!

510
35:32.540 --> 35:33.060
Chunhua!

511
35:41.140 --> 35:42.020
What a night!

512
35:42.620 --> 35:43.700
I'm completely exhausted.

513
35:47.100 --> 35:48.220
General Meng, it seems you've

514
35:48.740 --> 35:50.260
joined forces with the Crown Prince.

515
35:51.900 --> 35:52.980
Take me as a warning.

516
35:53.660 --> 35:56.020
The Mus' rule is rotten to the core.

517
35:57.060 --> 35:58.980
If you devote your life to serving the Mu family,

518
35:59.540 --> 36:01.700
they'll dispose of you once you've served your purpose.

519
36:03.940 --> 36:04.500
So?

520
36:05.300 --> 36:06.660
What I'm saying is,

521
36:08.820 --> 36:09.540
the Meng family of North Jing

522
36:10.700 --> 36:12.180
has produced heroes for generations.

523
36:13.180 --> 36:14.460
Surely you don't intend

524
36:14.820 --> 36:16.420
to spend your whole life

525
36:16.420 --> 36:18.580
as a mere military governor of the Central Circuit?

526
36:20.980 --> 36:22.100
The Meng family's

527
36:22.380 --> 36:24.060
cavalry is unstoppable.

528
36:24.900 --> 36:27.660
And I command Huai's Shence Army,

529
36:28.020 --> 36:29.660
all 100,000 of its soldiers.

530
36:30.020 --> 36:31.380
If we join forces,

531
36:32.100 --> 36:35.300
we could put a whole new dynasty on the throne.

532
36:37.580 --> 36:38.220
Right.

533
36:40.940 --> 36:41.460
Lord Yu.

534
36:43.020 --> 36:44.740
But you're just stalling for time.

535
36:47.220 --> 36:48.220
What's with all the talk?

536
36:49.620 --> 36:49.940
Where's the deer?

537
36:50.380 --> 36:50.900
What deer?

538
36:51.180 --> 36:52.620
I came here to hunt the deer.

539
36:53.180 --> 36:54.260
Hunt the deer?

540
36:57.380 --> 37:00.660
Who would actually come here just to hunt a deer?

541
37:04.620 --> 37:06.780
You sent this scout to call for reinforcements, didn't you?

542
37:07.660 --> 37:08.900
He's quite the fast runner.

543
37:10.540 --> 37:11.340
Just one step away.

544
37:11.860 --> 37:14.660
He almost made it into the Shence Army's camp.

545
37:19.100 --> 37:19.420
Good.

546
37:20.900 --> 37:21.540
Very good.

547
37:24.460 --> 37:25.420
You care nothing for the throne,

548
37:26.060 --> 37:27.220
only for the woman you love.

549
37:28.660 --> 37:28.940
Good.

550
37:29.900 --> 37:30.300
Very good.

551
37:35.620 --> 37:36.540
To lose

552
37:37.820 --> 37:40.420
to a man as sincere and devoted as you,

553
37:41.540 --> 37:41.980
I have no regrets.

554
37:47.540 --> 37:48.900
If you'd just let me catch that deer sooner,

555
37:50.980 --> 37:52.020
none of this would've happened.

556
38:05.300 --> 38:12.200
(Yuhua Palace, Yu)

557
38:42.700 --> 38:49.660
(Yu)

558
38:54.820 --> 38:55.140
General!

559
38:55.380 --> 38:56.620
We've searched the entire temporary imperial palace.

560
38:56.780 --> 38:58.060
None of Yu's remaining followers survived.

561
38:58.540 --> 38:59.100
Withdraw the troops.

562
39:00.420 --> 39:01.860
But Princess Danyang is still inside.

563
39:20.300 --> 39:26.460
♪A daughter ventures forth, in the name her father gave♪

564
39:26.820 --> 39:32.980
♪Into savage lands, to tame tigers and slay wolves♪

565
39:34.460 --> 39:40.620
♪The fate is sealed, a destiny bestowed by Heaven♪

566
39:41.140 --> 39:44.860
♪When did you decide to defy it, to change it?♪

567
39:44.860 --> 39:48.340
♪When did you decide to defy it, to change it?♪

568
39:48.980 --> 39:52.520
♪Defy its might, and the submission it demands♪

569
39:52.520 --> 39:56.060
♪Defy its might, and the submission it demands♪

570
39:56.180 --> 39:59.600
♪Defy its scorn, stain the sky with blood♪

571
39:59.600 --> 40:03.340
♪Defy its scorn, stain the sky with blood♪

572
40:04.420 --> 40:05.140
You're free.

573
40:05.140 --> 40:07.780
♪We weren't born for sacrifice. Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

574
40:07.860 --> 40:10.380
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

575
40:10.540 --> 40:14.060
♪Cold as a blade, yet peerless as a bloom♪

576
40:14.380 --> 40:17.900
♪Who dares make me bow down in the dust?♪

577
40:17.940 --> 40:22.180
♪With sacrificed innocence and a soul snowbound♪

578
40:22.660 --> 40:23.460
You're free.

579
40:23.460 --> 40:24.900
♪If the road is blocked, I'll fight my way through♪

580
40:24.900 --> 40:28.020
♪Cut down the crowd, strike down the proud gods♪

581
40:28.140 --> 40:31.260
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

582
40:31.940 --> 40:36.020
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

583
40:36.500 --> 40:39.300
♪Don't be afraid, I'll become a demon for you♪

584
40:39.340 --> 40:45.580
♪Through fire, I'll turn the dark towers bright as day for you♪

585
40:46.220 --> 40:50.020
♪Though this world is hard to cross, I'll lead you through♪

586
40:50.220 --> 40:53.180
♪I dare face the unknown, with my sword in hand♪

587
40:53.500 --> 40:57.160
♪I'll guard my princess, and keep her tears at bay♪

588
40:57.340 --> 41:01.420
♪A tooth for a tooth; A scar for a scar♪

589
41:01.420 --> 41:05.700
♪A tooth for a tooth; A scar for a scar♪

590
41:06.460 --> 41:09.860
♪One song of slaughter follows another♪

591
41:11.140 --> 41:15.240
♪Mourn the blooms of youth; Mourn my bridal hair♪

592
41:15.240 --> 41:19.660
♪Mourn the blooms of youth; Mourn my bridal hair♪

593
41:20.260 --> 41:23.900
♪Not another tear shall fall♪

594
41:23.900 --> 41:24.740
Hurry! Take everything away!

595
41:29.460 --> 41:29.940
I'll take that.

596
41:44.860 --> 41:46.660
Princess Danyang has arrived!

597
41:57.860 --> 41:58.340
Chunhua!

598
42:05.620 --> 42:06.140
Your Highness.

599
42:08.180 --> 42:08.780
Are you all right?

600
42:11.060 --> 42:11.620
I'm fine.

601
42:23.140 --> 42:23.620
Wenji.

602
42:47.660 --> 42:48.220
You may leave.

603
43:02.100 --> 43:06.820
(Huai)

604
43:06.820 --> 43:07.140
Shang.

605
43:10.340 --> 43:11.300
You're the one who saved His Majesty?

606
43:12.060 --> 43:13.220
(Huai) Liu Wenji, you've really...

607
43:14.460 --> 43:15.540
got some nerve.

608
43:16.540 --> 43:18.580
How dare you pull that off right under Yu Cheng'an's nose?

609
43:24.340 --> 43:24.940
Actually,

610
43:26.540 --> 43:27.580
I had a lot on my mind at the time.

611
43:30.260 --> 43:31.260
But then I thought,

612
43:32.740 --> 43:34.220
I couldn't let Yu Cheng'an win like that.

613
43:35.420 --> 43:36.100
Whether it's Chunhua

614
43:36.660 --> 43:37.260
or her child,

615
43:37.980 --> 43:38.780
in his eyes,

616
43:40.260 --> 43:41.900
they're nothing but tools he can destroy

617
43:42.380 --> 43:43.220
or throw away at any moment.

618
43:45.660 --> 43:49.180
(Huai)

619
43:49.180 --> 43:50.060
I wanted to give Chunhua and her baby

620
43:50.940 --> 43:51.500
a chance to live.

621
43:56.100 --> 43:56.660
Wenji,

622
43:57.700 --> 43:58.380
that's just like you!

623
44:05.900 --> 44:06.340
Your Highness,

624
44:07.620 --> 44:08.340
where's Yu Cheng'an?

625
44:10.460 --> 44:11.020
He lost.

626
44:15.980 --> 44:20.740
(Next Episode Preview)

627
44:21.340 --> 44:21.740
Your Highness.

628
44:22.860 --> 44:23.340
What is it?

629
44:27.100 --> 44:27.580
Yan Shang,

630
44:28.580 --> 44:29.620
no matter when,

631
44:30.460 --> 44:31.900
no matter what happens,

632
44:33.380 --> 44:34.780
I'll protect you.

633
44:37.880 --> 44:41.173
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

634
44:43.858 --> 44:48.774
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

635
44:50.968 --> 44:56.813
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

636
44:57.313 --> 45:02.539
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

637
45:05.308 --> 45:10.099
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

638
45:10.935 --> 45:17.014
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

639
45:18.815 --> 45:21.965
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

640
45:21.965 --> 45:23.613
♪Burning bright as a song♪

641
45:23.665 --> 45:27.389
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

642
45:27.767 --> 45:32.433
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

643
45:33.052 --> 45:37.093
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

644
45:37.584 --> 45:39.699
♪Not a single hour less♪

645
45:39.739 --> 45:46.685
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

646
45:47.448 --> 45:50.901
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

647
45:51.081 --> 45:54.226
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

648
45:54.665 --> 46:01.302
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

649
46:01.699 --> 46:03.737
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

650
46:03.737 --> 46:06.213
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

651
46:06.251 --> 46:08.720
♪You're the only one I need♪

652
46:08.924 --> 46:15.811
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

653
46:16.123 --> 46:19.394
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

654
46:19.699 --> 46:22.872
♪My last untouched innocence♪

655
46:23.196 --> 46:26.622
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

656
46:26.855 --> 46:30.080
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

657
46:30.411 --> 46:37.207
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

658
46:37.576 --> 46:39.638
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

659
46:39.639 --> 46:42.142
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

660
46:42.189 --> 46:44.527
♪You're the only one I need♪

661
46:44.758 --> 46:51.593
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

662
46:51.942 --> 46:53.560
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

663
46:53.690 --> 46:55.486
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

664
46:55.843 --> 46:58.860
♪You're the only one I need♪

665
46:58.900 --> 47:00.227
(No animals were harmed or mistreated in production.)
